flowchart LR
  subgraph monitor [Every 5 minutes - one instance via Redis lease]
    Probes[Probe API, database, Redis, email, every model provider]
    Checks[(status_checks)]
  end
  Traffic[Real chat turns - model answered or failed] --> Health[(Redis hourly model counters)]
  Probes --> Checks
  Checks -->|2 failures in a row| AutoInc[Automatic incident + alert email]
  Checks -->|2 passes| Resolve[Auto-resolve incident]

  subgraph public ["/status - public"]
    Overall[Overall state]
    Bars[90-day uptime bars per component]
    ModelRates[Per-model 24h success rates]
    Incidents[Current + past incidents with timeline]
    Report[Report a problem]
  end
  Checks --> Overall & Bars
  Health --> ModelRates
  AutoInc --> Incidents

  subgraph team [Team Console - Status & crashes]
    Manage[Post incidents and updates]
    Crashes[Crash groups by fingerprint + stack]
    RunNow[Run checks now]
  end
  Manage --> Incidents

  Report --> Ticket[High-priority support ticket] --> Inbox[Console Support inbox]
  Report --> Alert[Alert email to STATUS_ALERT_EMAILS / support identity / owners]
  Ticket --> Confirm[Confirmation email to the reporter]
  App[Web app error screen + uncaught errors] --> CrashAPI["/api/status/crash"] --> Crashes
